#: ../Site/Landing.qml:335
msgid "Ljós strives to follow the <a href=\"https://community-software.org/\">Community Software</a> principles: we build it together, as peers, in the open.<br><br>Everyone is welcome.<br>We are peers.<br>Every contribution counts.<br>Influence grows from participation.<br>Be kind to people, rigorous with ideas.<br>“No” and “not yet” are valid answers.<br>Look after yourself and each other.<br><br>Code is one way to help. Testing, docs, design, translation and accessibility reviews count as much, and questions from newcomers are welcome."
msgstr "Ljós 致力于遵循 <a href=\"https://community-software.org/\">Community Software</a> 原则：我们平等协作，在开放中共同构建。<br><br>欢迎每一个人。<br>我们彼此平等。<br>每一份贡献都很重要。<br>影响力源于参与。<br>善待他人，严谨对待想法。<br>“不”和“暂时不行”都是合理的回答。<br>照顾好自己，也关心彼此。<br><br>写代码只是帮忙的一种方式。测试、文档、设计、翻译和无障碍评审同样重要，也非常欢迎新手提问。"

